{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/RetryOnAfterFlatMapping"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Gathers elements into arrays and emits each array when the strategy says to flush.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"batch","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"strategy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncSequences","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Batch","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Batch","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO5BatchV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BatchStrategy","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyP"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci7ElementQa"},{"kind":"text","text":" == "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyP7ElementQa"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"strategy","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When to emit the gathered elements; its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"text":" is this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence’s, inferred from the call.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A sequence of the upstream’s elements, in order, in arrays of one or more.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The strategy decides when the pending elements are flushed: every so many elements","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/count(_:)","isActive":true},{"text":"), every interval","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/time(interval:clock:tolerance:)","isActive":true},{"text":"), on a signal or a unit of work","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/SignalBatchStrategy","isActive":true},{"text":"), whenever any of several does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/either(_:_:)","isActive":true},{"text":"), or by a rule of your own (","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy","isActive":true},{"text":"). After every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"flush, each strategy starts over. A flush with nothing pending emits nothing; the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence never emits an empty array.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When the upstream finishes, the pending elements, if any, are emitted as a last array and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the sequence finishes. When the upstream throws, the pending elements are dropped and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence throws the same error. A signal that finishes stops firing while the batches go","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on; a signal that throws ends the sequence with its error.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The upstream and the strategy run in tasks of their own, started when iteration begins,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the upstream is read ahead of the consumer, and arrays the consumer hasn’t taken yet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are buffered. Cancelling the consumer, or dropping its iterator, cancels both. An","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"upstream or signal that ignores cancellation keeps the internal task alive until its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pending ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"next()"},{"text":" returns, and is not read again after that; the batched sequence itself","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ends at once.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Batching needs iOS 16, Mac Catalyst 16, macOS 13, tvOS 16, watchOS 9 or visionOS 1.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","type":"heading"},{"code":["for try await batch in [1, 2, 3, 4].async.batch(strategy: .either(.count(3), .time(interval: .seconds(1), clock: ContinuousClock()))) {","    print(batch) \/\/ Prints [1, 2, 3], then [4]","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Any error the upstream or the strategy throws.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Throws","type":"aside"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"extendedModule":"_Concurrency","title":"batch(strategy:)","externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE5batch8strategyAA14AsyncSequencesO5BatchVy_xqd__Gqd___tAA0H8StrategyRd__ACQyd__ADRSlF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO23RetryOnAfterFlatMappingC","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"batch","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"strategy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Batch","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO5BatchV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"relatedModules":["_Concurrency"],"name":"Afluent"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/SequenceOperators\/BatchSequence.swift#L221","fileName":"BatchSequence.swift"},"role":"symbol","platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS"},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iPadOS"},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst"},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false